# DSL 2.0 in one reel (#39): a test scene, @JINX, REMEMBER as a member, START WITH:, IF, history in
# brackets, SET by member with a word, and a cut with a chance. Generate from clip 1, seed fixed.
@h3 references 2:3 0.6MP
style: live-action, TikTok reel

CAST
@JINX (refmod minimaxh3_jinx_v1_refmod): a skinny and pretty alternative young woman around 20 years old.

SCENE the mirror (test)
SHOT 5s: static
@JINX stands in front of a mirror in a small bedroom and shows her outfit.
REMEMBER: frame at 2s as @JINX

SCENE the room
$mood = {calm|tense|playful}
START WITH: the camera faces a closed bedroom door
SHOT 6s: static
The door opens and @JINX steps into the room, $mood.
END ON: @JINX stands at the window

SCENE the window ×2
SET: @JINX(0.6, refmods)
$mood = {calm|tense|playful}
SHOT 5s: push in
@JINX looks out of the window, now $mood, a moment ago $mood[-1].
IF $mood is tense: @JINX (whispering): Someone is out there.
END ON: @JINX turns to the camera
CUT TO: the room (30%) ×1
